        "answer": {
          "short": "Incorrect. The rise was 25%, not a tripling.",
          "worked": "$250\\,000-200\\,000=50\\,000$.\n$\\dfrac{50\\,000}{200\\,000}\\times100\\%=25\\%$.\nThe price became 1.25 times its original value, not three times.",
